Interpretation:

  - The two Pods formed a two-rank, two-node NCCL communicator over RoCE/IB.
  - GPU Direct RDMA was reported as disabled; this run therefore does not
    claim GPU-direct RDMA performance.
  - The v0.17.0 run also emitted a non-fatal FlashInfer workspace warning for
    MNNVL; the standard path still completed. The demo YAML patches the v0.17.0
    backend list to empty before running, so this optional path is excluded in
    repeat runs.
